WEBVTT

00:11:29.625 --> 00:11:31.726
where the percentage
of the white population

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.059
has also increased,

00:11:33.083 --> 00:11:35.143
aka gentrification,

00:11:35.167 --> 00:11:38.059
aka unicycles and oat milk,

00:11:38.083 --> 00:11:40.976
aka when BBQ Becky feels threatened,

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:45.309
she becomes a threat to me
in my own neighborhood,

00:11:45.333 --> 00:11:47.643
which forces me and people like me

00:11:47.667 --> 00:11:49.684
to police ourselves.

00:11:49.708 --> 00:11:52.726
We quiet ourselves, we walk on eggshells,

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.434
we maybe pull over to the side of the road

00:11:55.458 --> 00:11:57.434
under the brightest light we can find

00:11:57.458 --> 00:11:59.309
so that our murder

00:11:59.333 --> 00:12:02.226
might be caught cleanly on camera,